        {
          "text": "Isu de ’ba azini indi, yi de alatarakokoru avu ’bani ma e’yosi, econi yini ani agaza ’ba drilesiri ma ta mbazu o’du ndesi ku. O’du nderisi yi emu Musa pi ma drilia Aroni be; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.6"
